---
description: Redact sensitive information from screenshots before sharing externally
alwaysApply: false
globs: "**/*"
---

Before sharing or exporting screenshots that may contain sensitive data, use `superbased_redact`:

- `secrets: true` (default) — redacts API keys, tokens, passwords, connection strings
- `pii: true` — redacts emails, phone numbers, names, addresses

Always redact when:
- Screenshots show terminal output with environment variables
- Screenshots show browser sessions with logged-in accounts
- Screenshots show settings, config files, or dashboards
- Screenshots will be shared externally or included in bug reports
